7386_tn.jpg" alt=""/></a>&nbsp;<a href="https://www.wikiloc.com/hiking-trails/la-tambura-la-focoletta-m-crispo-139430408/photo-88467389"><img width="60" height="60" src="https://s2.wklcdn.com/image_224/6736771/139430408/88467389_tn.jpg" alt=""/></a>&nbsp;<a href="https://www.wikiloc.com/hiking-trails/la-tambura-la-focoletta-m-crispo-139430408/photo-88467391"><img width="60" height="60" src="https://s1.wklcdn.com/image_224/6736771/139430408/88467391_tn.jpg" alt=""/></a>&nbsp;<a href="https://www.wikiloc.com/hiking-trails/la-tambura-la-focoletta-m-crispo-139430408/photo-88467392"><img width="60" height="60" src="https://s2.wklcdn.com/image_224/6736771/139430408/88467392_tn.jpg" alt=""/></a>&nbsp;<a href="https://www.wikiloc.com/hiking-trails/la-tambura-la-focoletta-m-crispo-139430408/photo-88467394"><img width="60" height="60" src="https://s1.wklcdn.com/image_224/6736771/139430408/88467394_tn.jpg" alt=""/></a>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td colspan="2">Partenza da Resceto, vi consiglio di arrivare presto per trovare parcheggio, nel nostro caso abbiamo dovuto lasciare l'auto lungo la strada.... <a style="color:#2B60DE" href="https://www.wikiloc.com/hiking-trails/la-tambura-la-focoletta-m-crispo-139430408">">read more &rarr;</a></td></tr><tr><td align="right" colspan="2"><br/><a style="color:#2B60DE"href="https://www.wikiloc.com/wikiloc/upload.do"><b>Upload your trail to wikiloc.com &rarr;</b></a></td></tr></table>]]></description><Point><coordinates>10.210207,44.088031,448.8</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Path</name><styleUrl>#lineStyle</styleUrl><MultiGeometry><LineString><coordinates>10.210207,44.088031,448.854 10.210369,44.08804,448.856 10.210359,44.088093,448.811 10.210381,44.088048,464.709 10.210383,44.088095,480.336 10.210346,44.08815,498.438 10.210359,44.088202,498.434 10.210381,44.088252,496.429 10.210346,44.088297,496.568 10.210278,44.088335,497.445 10.210233,44.088372,497.229 10.210188,44.08841,497.445 10.210125,44.088437,496.963 10.210095,44.08849